### Feature Client — UPDATE (PUT) / UPDATE (PATCH) (JWT + RBAC)
### `is_active` no se envía: el estado solo cambia con PATCH /api/clientes/:id/deactivate
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@token = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
@id = 1

### LOGIN como admin (ejecutar PRIMERO: guarda el token en @token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### PUT — reemplazo completo
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tipo_documento": "CC",
  "numero_documento": "1234567890",
  "nombre": "Ana Pérez Actualizada",
  "telefono": "3009876543",
  "email": "ana.perez@example.com"
}

### PATCH — parcial
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/clientes/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "telefono": "3011112233"
}
